            "Moisture in its breath condenses inside the nose and is taken back.",
            "Its body temperature rises by several degrees in the day and falls at night.",
            "It sweats only at the top of that range, which saves water.",
            "Its thick coat keeps the sun’s heat off the skin; shorn camels lost more water.",
            "Its oval red blood cells keep flowing when the blood thickens.",
            "It can drink a huge amount quickly, and its blood cells swell without bursting.",
