            {"q": "What did experiments with shorn camels show?", "a": ["Their temperature stayed the same all day", "They stayed cooler and sweated less", "Their humps shrank faster", "They lost more water than camels left with their coats"], "c": 3, "kind": "detail"},
            {"q": "What does the passage say about a camel’s red blood cells?", "a": ["They store water in the hump", "They are oval, which helps them keep flowing in thick blood", "They are round, so they can carry more oxygen", "They are larger than those of any other mammal"], "c": 1, "kind": "detail"},
